-- Theorem C (integral forms are long: a lower bound for the covolume of
-- the lifts of an almost spanning family of small index), and the family
-- given by Theorems A and B.
-- Source: grh-compact/src/New/Endgame/LongForms.lean. Part of: The
-- inequality (⋆): upper bound for weighted non-split primes (see
-- GRH.Proof.Main). "This file: Theorem C (Data.integral_forms_long: a
-- lower bound for the covolume of the lifts of an almost spanning family
-- of small index), and the family given by Theorems A and B."
-- Part of the GRH blueprint (layer 5, the argument).
